Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 08:40:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/7] [Pascal] Small-M Triton GEMM for large unquantized
 matrices (lm_head)

cuBLAS pads decode-sized GEMMs to 64-row tiles on sm_60; for N >= 4096 (the
248k-vocab lm_head) a skinny Triton kernel reads the weight once.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
